---
import Layout from "../../components/Layout.astro";
---
<!-- TODO: have this reviewed before applying to AdSense; keep it in line with the root site's policy. -->
<Layout lang="en" title="Privacy policy | Baitaan Brazil" description="How Baitaan's tools for Brazil handle your data, which cookies they use, and how ads and the newsletter work.">
  <article class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-ink">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>Our calculators run in your browser. The numbers you type and the files you choose are not sent to our servers.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use these cookies on pt.baitaandessigns.com:</p>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead><tr class="text-muted"><th class="py-2 text-start font-medium">Cookie</th><th class="py-2 text-start font-medium">What it does</th><th class="py-2 text-start font-medium">Lasts</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="border-t border-hair"><td class="py-2 font-mono">bt_theme</td><td>Remembers whether you chose the light or dark theme.</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-t border-hair"><td class="py-2 font-mono">bt_lang</td><td>Remembers whether you chose Portuguese or English on this site.</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-t border-hair"><td class="py-2 font-mono">bt_consent</td><td>Stores your cookie choice.</td><td>6 months</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>These three are necessary and are not used to identify you. Google's cookies are only used if you accept them: Google Analytics to measure visits, and Google AdSense to personalise ads. If you reject them, you may still see non-personalised ads.</p>
    <p>Under Brazil's data protection law (LGPD) you can withdraw your consent at any time with the “Cookie settings” link at the bottom of every page. Learn how Google uses data at <a class="text-link underline" href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">policies.google.com</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Newsletter</h2>
    <p>If you subscribe to the newsletter at the bottom of the page, we store your email address, the date and the site you signed up on, only to tell you about new tools. We never share it. To unsubscribe or have your address deleted, write to hello@baitaandessigns.com.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Contact</h2>
    <p>hello@baitaandessigns.com</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
